            "metabolic", "neonatologist + geneticist", "advanced",
            "GALT deficiency. Lactose-free diet immediate. Risk: liver failure, sepsis (E. coli, GBS), cataracts, NDI long-term.",
            "## Patofiziologia\n\n- **GALT deficiency** (most common — galactosemia type I) — most severe form\n- Other types: GALK (galactokinase) — cataracts only; GALE (epimerase) — variable\n\n## Presentation\n\n### Classical galactosemia\n- After lactose ingestion (formula or breastmilk):\n- **Vomiting, poor feeding** (1-7 d жизни)\n- **Hepatomegaly + jaundice** (direct hyperbilirubinemia)\n- **Liver failure progression** (coagulopathy, ascites)\n- **E. coli sepsis or GBS sepsis** (40 % cases — galactose-1-P inhibits leukocyte function)\n- **Cataracts** (late finding)\n- **Renal Fanconi syndrome**\n\n### Long-term (даже с treatment)\n- Speech / language delays\n- Learning disabilities\n- Ovarian failure (girls)\n- Tremor, ataxia (some)\n\n## Diagnostics\n\n### Newborn screening\n- **Galactose-1-phosphate** (GAL-1-P) elevated\n- **GALT enzyme activity** quantitative\n- Confirmation: GALT genotyping\n- РФ + RUSP includes galactosemia screening\n\n### Acute workup\n- LFT, coag, glucose\n- Reducing substances в urine (positive for galactose)\n- Sepsis workup (mandatory)\n\n## Treatment\n\n### Immediate (do NOT wait для confirmation)\n1. **Stop ALL lactose-containing nutrition** — formula switch к **lactose-free** (Pregestimil, Nutramigen без lactose, soy-based)\n2. **Sepsis workup + empiric ampicillin + gentamicin**\n3. **IV fluids** D10 (no lactose-containing IVF)\n4. **FFP** для coagulopathy (vit K-dependent factors)\n5. **PRBC** для anemia\n\n### Long-term\n- **Lifelong galactose-restricted diet** (lactose-free, all dairy excluded)\n- **Calcium + Vit D supplementation** (dairy-free → deficiency)\n- **Speech / language therapy**\n- **Ophthalmology follow-up** (cataracts)\n- **Endocrinology** (ovarian failure puberty assessment)\n- **Genetic counseling**\n\n## Calculator Bordik\n- neo-perinatal-infections-class\n- neo-newborn-screening (timing)\n\n## Источники\n- Berry GT. Galactosemia. Mol Genet Metab 2014;111:127\n- Welling L et al. JIMD Reports 2017\n- Приказ МЗ РФ 2023 (Расширенный screening)",
